00:36:17.260 --> 00:36:21.230
or to engage in a broader
sense and data science.

00:36:21.230 --> 00:36:24.160
I don't want to create a
world in which future data

00:36:24.160 --> 00:36:26.260
scientists feel like
they need to have a blog

00:36:26.260 --> 00:36:28.660
or they need to have
an active social media

00:36:28.660 --> 00:36:30.978
