00:36:43.270 --> 00:36:46.205
Personally, I enjoy
them, but I would just

00:36:46.205 --> 00:36:48.580
hate to pick someone over
someone else because, you know,

00:36:48.580 --> 00:36:50.350
someone is sort of
more naturally inclined

00:36:50.350 --> 00:36:52.180
to do that sort of
work than someone else.

00:36:52.180 --> 00:36:55.360
And then, of course, it depends
