00:37:17.862 --> 00:37:19.612
And I want to share
it with the community,

00:37:19.612 --> 00:37:21.760
and it doesn't seem like
too much of a heavy lift.

00:37:21.760 --> 00:37:23.710
I don't think he's
applying, but if he was,

00:37:23.710 --> 00:37:25.820
I feel like that's
something he could bring up.

00:37:25.820 --> 00:37:27.362
And maybe that's a
lighter weight way

00:37:27.362 --> 00:37:29.200
